  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Cut the tomato into 2cm chunks. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves. Slice the haloumi. Combine the garlic, Tex-Mex seasoning and 2 tsp olive oil in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the haloumi and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2198962/photos/large/68961_1-1514b564b2d00a2c5581d0c22a162514.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dress salad leaves: Combine 2 tsp olive oil and ½ tsp red wine vinegar in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the salad leaves and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2198963/photos/large/68961_2-f0024dc0fb9d0566061cf84c32fc9489.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pan-fry haloumi: Heat a medium frypan over medium-high heat. Cook the haloumi for 2 mins each side or until golden. Remove from the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2198964/photos/large/68961_3-3a375e322f7f63c5f580b89fa659a7e5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm tortillas: Put the tortillas on a plate, slightly overlapping, and microwave for 30 secs or until warmed through (see Kitchen hack).",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2198965/photos/large/68961_4-a388348f4d4db52ae58481ea7569f726.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Spread the tortillas with the burger sauce, then top with the haloumi, salad leaves and tomato. Roll up and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2198966/photos/large/68961_5-445f057bf130365f21c9d42ca4815e48.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen hack: If you don't have a microwave, heat a large frypan over medium-high heat. Warm the tortillas, in batches, for 30 secs each side or until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2198967/photos/large/68961_6-856c9e80792b548f080671739e280d89.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
